---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="ANUHub">
  <h1>ANUHub</h1>
  <p>
    A small original prototype inspired by ANU's student administration
    portal — see <a href="/readme/">About</a> for what this is and isn't.
    Its one real pain point: several menus below are only open during
    specific windows, and it's not obvious from the real site when a closed
    one reopens. Here, every closed menu item is greyed out, unclickable, and
    tells you exactly when it opens again — reading the same availability
    data that decides whether it's open at all.
  </p>
  <p>Try Special Consideration (open now) or Course Enrolment (not yet open) from the nav above.</p>
</Layout>
